namespace OresCodegenKeysAndColumns

// UVL model of entity_meta_model_keys_and_columns.org's non-structural
// variability. HasTenantId, HasWorkspaceId and HasParentId are
// authored, read through by the generator, and control template
// conditional logic -- they do not themselves become a field called
// "has_tenant_id" on the entity. Whether the resulting tenant_id or
// workspace_id column exists is a structural consequence of that
// decision, not the decision itself, so the columns are not modeled
// here. HasParentId's consequence has the same shape: it decides
// whether the hierarchy block is emitted at all, and the two
// properties that block reads, ParentIdColumn and HierarchyNameField,
// are columns the model already declares.

features
    KeysAndColumns {abstract}
        optional
            HasTenantId
            HasWorkspaceId
            HasParentId
